meep
------------------------------------------
Meep (or MEEP) is a free finite-difference time-domain (FDTD) simulation
software package developed at MIT to model electromagnetic systems.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  cygwin-devel-3.6.12-1
  libGDSII0-0.21-1bl3
  libctl7-4.7.1-1bl1
  libfftw3-devel-3.3.11-1
  libfftw3_3-3.3.11-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgsl-devel-2.3-2
  libgsl19-2.3-2
  libguile3.0_1-3.0.11-1
  libharminv-devel-1.4.3-1bl1
  libharminv3-1.4.3-1bl1
  libhdf5-devel-2.2.0-1
