  https://github.com/NanoComp/meep/archive/refs/tags/v1.35.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack meep-1.35.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./meep-1.35.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/meep-1.35.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/meep-1.35.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmeep39-1.35.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libpympb39-1.35.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-meep-1.35.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmeep-devel-1.35.1-X.tar.xz

